+ * `:!` pathspec exclusions (each path and its contents) for `git add` staging
+ * commands, e.g. `git add . -- <specs> ":!factory-kit" ":!factory-kit/**"`.
+ * Quoted, so a shell (or cli_execute_command) never splits paths.
+ */
